{"slug":"tim-johnson-south-dakota-politician","qid":"Q925052","name":"Tim Johnson","desc":"American politician of South Dakota (1946–2024)","article":"Tim Johnson (South Dakota politician)","born":"1946-12-28","died":"2024-10-08","birthplace":"Canton","parties":["Democratic Party"],"offices":[{"t":"U.S. Senator","w":"South Dakota","f":1997,"u":2015},{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"SD-AL","f":1987,"u":1997},{"t":"South Dakota Senate","w":"","f":1983,"u":1987},{"t":"South Dakota House of Representatives","w":"","f":1979,"u":1983}],"summary":"Timothy Peter Johnson (December 28, 1946 – October 8, 2024) was an American lawyer and politician who served as a United States senator from South Dakota from 1997 to 2015. A member of the Democratic Party, he served as the United States representative for South Dakota's at-large congressional district from 1987 to 1997 and in the South Dakota Legislature from 1979 to 1987. Johnson is the last Democrat to hold statewide and/or congressional office in South Dakota.","photo":null,"history":[{"y":2008,"o":"S","k":"SD","p":"D","v":237889,"s":62.49,"w":true,"n":"Tim Johnson"},{"y":2002,"o":"S","k":"SD","p":"D","v":167481,"s":49.62,"w":true,"n":"Tim Johnson"},{"y":1996,"o":"S","k":"SD","p":"D","v":166533,"s":51.32,"w":true,"n":"Tim Johnson"},{"y":1994,"o":"H","k":"SD-AL","p":"D","v":183036,"s":59.83,"w":true,"n":"Tim Johnson"},{"y":1992,"o":"H","k":"SD-AL","p":"D","v":230070,"s":69.11,"w":true,"n":"Tim Johnson"},{"y":1990,"o":"H","k":"SD-AL","p":"D","v":173814,"s":67.55,"w":true,"n":"Tim Johnson"},{"y":1988,"o":"H","k":"SD-AL","p":"D","v":223759,"s":71.74,"w":true,"n":"Tim Johnson"},{"y":1986,"o":"H","k":"SD-AL","p":"D","v":171462,"s":59.18,"w":true,"n":"Tim Johnson"}]}